<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Watchlog admin</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfaf8; --fg: #16151a; --muted: #6d6a75;
    --rule: #e3e0da; --accent: #c2762a; --danger: #a8352b; --card: #fff;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #131217; --fg: #f0eeea; --muted: #918d99;
      --rule: #2a2830; --accent: #fdb041; --danger: #e8756a; --card: #1b1a21;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
                 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.45; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 5rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted); margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .note a { color: var(--accent); }

  ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  li {
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.85rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; background: var(--card);
  }
  .body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .title { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .title .detail { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
  .meta {
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .badge { color: var(--accent); }
  .count { color: var(--muted); text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }

  button {
    font: inherit; font-size: 0.8rem; cursor: pointer;
    background: none; border: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--muted);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }
  button:hover { border-color: var(--danger); color: var(--danger); }
  .restore button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .empty { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .epname { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.87rem; margin-top: 0.1rem; }

  /* The edit form is a <details> so it stays collapsed and needs no script. */
  details.edit { flex-basis: 100%; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  details.edit summary {
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; list-style: none;
  }
  details.edit summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.edit summary::before { content: "+ "; }
  details.edit[open] summary::before { content: "− "; }
  details.edit summary:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .fields {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center; margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .fields label {
    font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .fields input {
    font: inherit; font-size: 0.85rem; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .fields input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }
  .fields input.num { width: 4.2rem; }
  .fields input.name { flex: 1; min-width: 11rem; }
  .fields button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  details.add {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--card);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  details.add summary {
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; list-style: none;
  }
  details.add summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  details.add summary::before { content: "+ "; }
  details.add[open] summary::before { content: "− "; }
  details.add summary:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  /* .fields is display:flex for the inline edit form; here the rows should
     stack full-width instead, so the title field has room to grow. */
  details.add .fields { display: block; margin-top: 0.85rem; }
  details.add .row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }
  details.add .row + .row { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .fields select {
    font: inherit; font-size: 0.85rem; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .fields input.date { width: 10rem; }
  .fields input.svc { width: 9rem; }
  .fields input.wide { flex: 1; min-width: 12rem; }
  .ok {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .warn {
    border: 1px solid var(--danger); color: var(--danger); background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <h1>Watchlog admin</h1>
  {% if error %}
  <p class="warn">{{ error }} — nothing was changed.</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% if notice %}
  <p class="ok">{{ notice }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="note">
    Deleting hides an entry and republishes immediately. Nothing is destroyed, so
    anything removed can be restored below. Apple TV entries arrive with no season,
    episode or episode title — the device doesn't report them — so those can be
    filled in by hand. Netflix and anything else no sensor reaches can be added
    outright — the IMDb link and year are looked up for you.
    The published page shows
    {% if published %}the most recent {{ published }} entries{% else %}every entry{% endif %} —
    <a href="https://adamwitwer.com/watchlog/">view it</a>.
  </p>

  <details class="add">
    <summary>Add an entry by hand</summary>
    <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('add') }}">
      <div class="fields">
        <div class="row">
          <label for="add-date">Watched</label>
          <input class="date" type="date" id="add-date" name="date"
                 value="{{ today }}" required>
          <label for="add-service">On</label>
          <input class="svc" type="text" id="add-service" name="service"
                 list="services" placeholder="Netflix" maxlength="40" required>
          <datalist id="services">
            {% for s in services %}<option value="{{ s }}">{% endfor %}
          </datalist>
          <select name="media_type" aria-label="Type">
            <option value="episode">Episode</option>
            <option value="movie">Movie</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <input class="wide" type="text" name="title" maxlength="200" required
                 placeholder="Title — the series name, or the film">
          <input class="num" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="year"
                 placeholder="Year">
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <label>Season</label>
          <input class="num" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="season">
          <label>Ep</label>
          <input class="num" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="episode">
          <input class="wide" type="text" name="episode_title" maxlength="200"
                 placeholder="Episode title (optional)">
          <button type="submit">Add</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </details>

  <h2>Published — {{ visible|length }} entries</h2>
  {% if visible %}
  <ul>
    {% for entry in visible %}
    <li>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="title">
          {{ entry.title }}
          {%- if entry.detail %} <span class="detail">{{ entry.detail }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if entry.episode_names %}
        <div class="epname">{{ entry.episode_names }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="meta">
          {{ entry.date_label }} / <span class="badge">{{ entry.service }}</span>
          {%- if entry.ids|length > 1 %}
          / <span class="count">{{ entry.ids|length }} events</span>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('hide') }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="ids" value="{{ entry.id_list }}">
        <button type="submit">Delete</button>
      </form>
      {% if entry.editable %}
      <details class="edit">
        <summary>Edit episode details</summary>
        <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('edit') }}">
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ entry.editable['id'] }}">
          <div class="fields">
            <label for="s{{ entry.editable['id'] }}">Season</label>
            <input class="num" type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric"
                   id="s{{ entry.editable['id'] }}" name="season"
                   value="{{ entry.editable['season'] if entry.editable['season'] is not none }}">
            <label for="e{{ entry.editable['id'] }}">Ep</label>
            <input class="num" type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric"
                   id="e{{ entry.editable['id'] }}" name="episode"
                   value="{{ entry.editable['episode'] if entry.editable['episode'] is not none }}">
            <input class="name" type="text" name="episode_title" maxlength="200"
                   placeholder="Episode title"
                   value="{{ entry.editable['episode_title'] or '' }}">
            <button type="submit">Save</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </details>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">Nothing published yet.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <h2>Deleted — {{ hidden|length }} entries</h2>
  {% if hidden %}
  <ul>
    {% for entry in hidden %}
    <li>
      <div class="body">
        <div class="title">
          {{ entry.title }}
          {%- if entry.detail %} <span class="detail">{{ entry.detail }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="meta">
          {{ entry.date_label }} / <span class="badge">{{ entry.service }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form method="post" action="{{ url_for('restore') }}" class="restore">
        <input type="hidden" name="ids" value="{{ entry.id_list }}">
        <button type="submit">Restore</button>
      </form>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">Nothing deleted.</p>
  {% endif %}

</div>
</body>
</html>
